# AURA Ultra-Clean Horizontal Architecture 

This diagram abandons nested subgraphs in favor of a strict Left-to-Right progression (Client -> API -> Logic -> DB). This structure is universally supported by all Mermaid renderers and **will not** have overlapping boxes or messy lines.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    %% ==========================================
    %% GLOBAL STYLES (Premium Aesthetic)
    %% ==========================================
    classDef client fill:#0f172a,stroke:#38bdf8,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc,rx:8px,ry:8px
    classDef edge fill:#1e1b4b,stroke:#8b5cf6,stroke-width:2px,color:#f8fafc,rx:8px,ry:8px
    classDef logic fill:#1e293b,stroke:#f472b6,stroke-width:2px,color:#fdf2f8,rx:8px,ry:8px
    classDef storage fill:#064e3b,stroke:#34d399,stroke-width:2px,color:#ecfdf5,rx:8px,ry:8px
    classDef cloud fill:#4c1d95,stroke:#c084fc,stroke-width:2px,color:#f5f3ff,rx:8px,ry:8px

    %% ==========================================
    %% NODES DEFINITION
    %% ==========================================

    %% 1. Client Layer
    WebUI["🌐 Web UI<br>(Jinja2 Templates)"]:::client
    Theme["🎨 Theme Engine<br>(CSS Variables)"]:::client
    PWA["📱 PWA Caching<br>(Service Worker)"]:::client

    %% 2. Network / Edge Layer
    Gateway["🚀 app.py<br>(Flask + WebSockets)"]:::edge
    Security["🛡️ Security<br>(Auth & Limiter)"]:::edge

    %% 3. Business Logic
    AIService["🤖 Gemini Router<br>(Context Builder)"]:::logic
    StressEngine["📊 Stress Engine<br>(EMA Algorithm)"]:::logic
    Routes["🔀 Blueprints<br>(Route Handling)"]:::logic

    %% 4. Storage
    DB[("🍃 MongoDB<br>(PyMongo)")]:::storage

    %% 5. External APIs
    Gemini["✨ Gemini 2.5 API<br>(LLM Support)"]:::cloud
    SMS["✉️ Fast2SMS<br>(Parent OTPs)"]:::cloud

    %% ==========================================
    %% RELATIONSHIPS (Strictly Left to Right)
    %% ==========================================

    %% Client Operations
    Theme -->|"Injects Classes"| WebUI
    PWA -.->|"Caches Assets"| WebUI
    WebUI <-->|"HTTP / Socket.IO"| Gateway

    %% Edge to Logic
    Gateway -->|"Applies Rules"| Security
    Security -->|"Valid Requests"| Routes

    %% Logic Routing
    Routes <-->|"Triggers Chats"| AIService
    Routes <-->|"Calculates Health"| StressEngine
    Routes -.->|"Direct DB Queries"| DB

    %% Logic to Storage & Outside
    StressEngine -.->|"Update Scores"| DB
    AIService <-->|"REST API"| Gemini
    Routes -->|"Send Code"| SMS
```
